Yukawa: beta(c_b) ~ eta*g**2/(4*pi**2)  beta(c_f) ~ -eta*g**2/(24*pi**2)
  rate ratio boson/fermion = 6 (C_T ratio Dirac/real scalar = 6)
  C_T-weighted sum 1*beta_b + 6*beta_f = 0
  relative-speed rate d(eta)/dlnmu / eta = 7*g**2/(24*pi**2)
QED: beta(c_g) ~ e**2*eta/(6*pi**2)  beta(c_f) ~ -e**2*eta/(3*pi**2)
  rate ratio fermion/photon = 2 (C_T ratio Maxwell/Dirac = 2)
  C_T-weighted sum 12*beta_g + 6*beta_f = 0
  relative rate = e**2/(2*pi**2)  = (alpha/4pi) * 8  (DGLAP lambda+ for QED, 1 flavour = 8; with |beta0|=4/3 -> exponent 3 = KLP Q^-3)
